{% if example %}{% raw %}# Abstract

This repository is a minimal template for drafting academic papers with
artificial intelligence (AI)-assisted coding agents. Summary scores use the
standard deviation (SD). The source files are written in Markdown and
rendered to Word with Pandoc. The example manuscript intentionally
includes the core artifact types needed for a reliable paper workflow:
section headings, body text, a generated figure, a generated table, a
citation, and a bibliography.
